# Unsubstantiate: "Return target spell or creature to its owner's hand"
# (Origin$ Battlefield,Stack). AbilityFactory.adjustChangeZoneTarget makes the
# Origin$ zones the target zones, so the Grizzly Bears spell on the stack is a
# legal target as its card (Card.inZoneStack). ChangeZoneEffect.java:577-579
# removes the spell from the stack (MagicStack.remove(Card)) and moves its card
# to its owner's hand: the Bears never resolve, and the stack ends empty.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 G
tapformana human 3 G
queue paygeneric G
castspell human 1
tapformana ai 7 U
tapformana ai 8 U
queue paygeneric U
queue targets 1
castspell ai 9
resolvestack
